						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Monday, February 16, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Knights of Nobility Accepting New Members </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							 As the winds of chaos died, only a few remained to stand strong against the darkness. They were deemed the Knights of Nobility by Mithaniel Marr himself.<BR><BR>Knights of Nobility seeks to shed light upon the inhabitants of Norrath and its heavens by banding together to facilitate hunting parties, protect each other from evil forces, and share our wealth of knowledge with each other.<BR><BR>If you are seeking a guild that is more interested in adventuring and exploring than being "uber", that doesn't require you to play a certain number of hours a week, likes to do a bit of roleplaying (nothing too strict), and that brings together like-minded players that enjoy all facets of the game (not just leveling), then we may be the guild for you!<BR><BR>Check out our website at www.knightsofnobility.com and make yourself known to us in our message forum!<BR><BR>Honor virutus preamium!<BR>Honor is the reward of virtue!<BR><BR>Sincerely,<BR>Tuwini Tooteeny<BR>Grand Duchess<BR>Knights of Nobility 
							<br><BR>
							 - Tuwini<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=470">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

						<TR><TD><p class="pTitle">New Revixi Website </p></TD></TR>
							<TR><TD><p class=pText>
							The website address for Revixi is now www.revixi.net
							 <BR><BR>- Medikraven - Ambassador<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=469">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

						<TR><TD><p class="pTitle">Updating Guild Listing again :P </p></TD></TR>
							<TR><TD><p class=pText>
							Ya Adra has nothing better to do LOL<BR>So PLEASE CHECK the Guild List and click YOUR guilds website and make sure it is correct for me.  Or MAKE sure I have it :)<BR><BR>Hope all had a GREAT VALENTINE'S DAY!  I did!
							 <BR><BR>- Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=471">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp; <a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=471">[View Comments]</a>

					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Saturday, February 14, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Gathered Might Recruiting </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Gathered Might is now recruiting the following classes-<BR><BR>Cleric-HIGH need.<BR>Monk-HIGH need.<BR>Rogue-high need.<BR>wizard-high need.<BR>Enchanter-high need.<BR>Shaman-moderate need.<BR><BR>All other classes are low need. You MUST be lvl 60 or above to apply, preferably 62+. No idiots plz kkthx.<BR><BR>If interested head over to www.gatheredmight.com. Click recruitment link to send in an application. If you wish to learn more about GM first, then click the Forums links and do a little reading first ).
							<br><BR>
							 - Drade<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=468">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, February 12, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Website for Norrathian Society of Anarchy Guild </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							The web address for Norrathian Society of Anarchy (NSA) has changed. It is now www.NSAGuild.com.  
							<br><BR>
							 - Frendina<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=467">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

						<TR><TD><p class="pTitle">Sistinas Recruiting lvl 45+ </p></TD></TR>
							<TR><TD><p class=pText>
							Sistinas is now recruiting lvl's 45-65, we raid 3 times a week and work on epic quests. We currently have 215 members all active and all 45+ (mostly 50+ now). we consider each guild mate as family and we are very organized.We have a bulletin board for members to post on and a private messenger on our website. Check out our website by clicking the Sistinas name in the guilds section and fill out the recruitment form. You can also check out our loots from previous raids on our website as well as raids upcoming. type /who all sistinas in game and ask any member to speak to me or any officer.<BR><BR>Exarch (Yates) ArcaneForce<BR>65 Cleric<BR>
							 <BR><BR>- sistinas<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=466">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							&nbsp; <a class="abody" href="comments.asp?Index=466">[View Comments]</a>

					<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Tuesday, February 10, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">NEW BOARDS </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							<html><body><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4"><b>Apparently there is a problem if you all have noticed with the Sol Ro Boards.</b></font></p><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4"><b>Some kind people got together and started a new board that seems to be taking off.</b></font></p><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4"><b><a href="http://www.solrorage.com/"></font><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="5"><b>A set of new forums</a></b></font></p><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4"><b>They have 177 registered users already so give some feedback here so Ganza can decide what to do next :)</b></font></p></body></html><BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=465">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Monday, February 09, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Knights of Nobility Accepting New Members </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							As the winds of chaos died, only a few remained to stand strong against the darkness.  They were deemed the Knights of Nobility by Mithaniel Marr himself.<BR><BR>Knights of Nobility seeks to shed light upon the inhabitants of Norrath and its heavens by banding together to facilitate hunting parties, protect each other from evil forces, and share our wealth of knowledge with each other.<BR><BR>If you are seeking a guild that is more interested in adventuring and exploring than being "uber", that doesn't require you to play a certain number of hours a week, likes to do a bit of roleplaying (nothing too strict), and that brings together like-minded players that enjoy all facets of the game (not just leveling), then we may be the guild for you!<BR><BR>Check out our website at www.knightsofnobility.com and make yourself known to us in our message forum!<BR><BR>Honor virutus preamium!<BR>Honor is the reward of virtue!<BR><BR>Sincerely,<BR>Tuwini Tooteeny<BR>Grand Duchess<BR>Knights of Nobility
							<br><BR>
							 - Tuwini<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=464">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, February 05, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Solusek Ro Forums BACK UP!!! </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							We maxed our bandwith really fast over at www.theangrycrayon.com, so we are now moved to our permanent address at www.solrorage.com.  All the threads from the old forum are in the process of being recovered, in the meantime, feel free to spam the forums and unleash some hate!<BR><BR>www.solrorage.com
							<br><BR>
							 - Miralyssa<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=458">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
<TR><TD><BR><img src=images/redline.gif height=2 width="100%"><BR><BR></TD></TR>
					

