							Solusek Ro's most funkdalicious level 60+ guild, House of Funk, is recruiting!  Come visit us at www.hofguild.org We're a fun-loving group who are working towards NToV, Sleepers and similar funky zones. If you are 60+, are mature but know how to have a good time, stop on by!<BR><BR>Muse Gilae Sul'delDraug<BR>The Funk Phenomenon<BR><BR>
